+# Activities
+
+Activities describe what happened on the boards you have access to, such as cards being added, assigned, moved, closed, or renamed, and comments being posted. They cover the same kinds of events as the account timeline, except that deprecated collection changes are omitted and card renames are included.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activities, newest first. Only activities from boards you have access to are returned.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the ID(s) of the user who performed the activity |
+
+Values within a parameter are ORed together. The two parameters combine with AND.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vb0ekn1ysx3enk5x9t7pq",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:37:10.000Z",
+    "description": "David assigned JZ to &quot;Layout is broken&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zlm2h1bkqj4nz0sjk3b"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/2",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+      "number": 2,
+      "title": "Layout is broken",
+      "status": "published",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/2"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy",
+      "name": "Writebook",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vb0ekn1ysx3enk5x9t7pr",
+    "action": "comment_created",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:02.000Z",
+    "description": "David commented on &quot;Layout is broken&quot;",
+    "particulars": {},
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/2#comment_03f5vb0ekn1ysx3enk5x9t7ps",
+    "eventable_type": "Comment",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vb0ekn1ysx3enk5x9t7ps",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:02.000Z",
+      "updated_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:02.000Z",
+      "body": {
+        "plain_text": "Looks good to me",
+        "html": "<div class=\"action-text-content\">Looks good to me</div>"
+      },
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      },
+      "card": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/2"
+      },
+      "reactions_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/2/comments/03f5vb0ekn1ysx3enk5x9t7ps/reactions",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/2/comments/03f5vb0ekn1ysx3enk5x9t7ps"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy",
+      "name": "Writebook",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+Each activity has the following fields:
+
+| Field | Description |
+|-------|-------------|
+| `id` | The activity ID |
+| `action` | The kind of activity (see below) |
+| `created_at` | When the activity happened |
+| `description` | A plain-text description of the activity |
+| `particulars` | Details specific to the action (see below) |
+| `url` | For card activities, the card. For comment activities, the card the comment was posted on, scrolled to that comment |
+| `eventable_type` | `Card` or `Comment` |
+| `eventable` | The card or comment, in the same shape as the cards and comments endpoints |
+| `board` | The board the activity happened on |
+| `creator` | The user who performed the activity |
+
+__Actions:__
+
+`card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_board_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_title_changed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `comment_created`
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+| Action | `particulars` |
+|--------|---------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids`: the IDs of the affected users |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board` and `new_board`: the board names |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title` and `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column`: the name of the column the card was moved into |
+| All other actions | An empty object |
+
+When a board, title, or column value is missing from an activity, it is returned as an empty string.
